        r += sqrt(rand_g1*rand_g1 + rand_g2*rand_g2);
    }
    shifts[j] = r / m;
} With reduction each thread accumulates its own partial sum in x and y and in the end all partial values are summed together in order to obtain the final values. Serial version:
