Then I was thinking about optimizing this, since I was not sure how OpenMP's thread management works. I wanted to prevent unnecessary initialization of the threads during each iteration, thus I put an outer parallel block around the outer loop. Second approach: #pragma omp parallel if(weightColumns > THRESHOLD)
