Thread 1 from group 1 working on data 11
Thread 0 from group 1 working on data 12
Thread 0 from group 1 working on data 13
Thread 2 from group 1 working on data 14
Thread 0 from group 1 working on data 15 But note that the nested approach may well change the thread assignments over what the one-level threading would be, so you will probably have to play with KMP_AFFINITY or other mechanisms a bit more to get the bindings right again.

